- Fixed portrait photos being posted sideways
- Video and link URLs no longer clutter the post body (they fold into cards; can be turned off in settings)
- Better tabs on phones: the tab "…" edits or removes the column, and tapping a tab no longer shifts the row under your finger
- Reordering columns no longer switches which column you are looking at
- New "Bold text" option in appearance settings
- On wide phone screens (like Fold cover displays) navigation moves to a left rail, giving you more vertical space
